# Split by context

Organize so each folder, file, and method has one clear context.

- Feature folders under Application (`Commands/<Feature>/`, `Queries/<Feature>/`).
- One public type per file; file name = type name.
- Methods do one job; extract a private method when a block has its own meaning.
- Prefer separate files for command `record` and handler when both grow past a few lines.

Do not invent extra layers for this — only clear placement by context.
